title trim page tags above the lines: OUT just inside the right edge (6:13.6) under the chip, the selected split 2 at 6:12.6 behind the OUT tag, split 1 at 5:15.5 behind the IN edge tag: the tags and the chip cover every line (outline in the panel colour), OUT drops one row below the chip; TRUE, then key F: FIT x8
sizes 480x800
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_PAGE trim
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1
env CASSETTE_DEMO_TRIM_QUIET 0.12
env CASSETTE_DEMO_TRIM_OUT 373600
env CASSETTE_DEMO_TRIM_SPLITS 315500,372600
env CASSETTE_DEMO_TRIM_SELECTED 1

wait 600
shot tags-oe-true
expect text "ZOOM"
key f
wait 300
shot tags-oe-fit
expect text "SAVE"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
